# kite
# a tally
# left by the builder of tally, 30 September 2026
# It goes a long way up before it comes down, and then it does something it will not stop doing.
# It steps only on wet days, so it is slow in a dry spell. Guess its rule from the plate before you read it.
kind: tally
rule: a / 2 if a % 2 == 0 else 3 * a + 1
start: 27
steps: wet days
flowers: spring, summer
colour: orange
stem: brittle
